OL,3,ATrump's 'energy ceasefire' claim
OL,4,Awelcomed by Zelensky but Russia silent
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump has claimed that Russia
OL,7,Fand Ukraine have agreed to an "energy
OL,8,Fceasefire", with Kyiv saying it would
OL,9,Fsupport such a move but Moscow yet to
OL,10,Fcomment.
OL,12,FThe US president insisted that it was
OL,13,F"effective immediately" but provided no
OL,14,Fdetails.
OL,16,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,17,Finitially expressed surprise at the
OL,18,Fannouncement, before saying Kyiv would
OL,19,Fsupport it if Moscow did. He also
OL,20,Faccused Russia of striking Ukrainian
OL,21,Fenergy facilities after Trump's post.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
