OL,3,ATrump's 'energy ceasefire' claim
OL,4,Awelcomed by Zelensky but Russia silent
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump has been urging Ukraine to stop
OL,7,Fstrikes on Russian oil infrastructure -
OL,8,Fwhich Kyiv says are vital to curtailing
OL,9,Frevenue for Moscow's war machine - so
OL,10,FRussia can fulfil a recently-struck
OL,11,Fdeal to release diesel to the US and
OL,12,Fthe global market.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
